## Instructions
- no-knead, quick focaccia features a crispy crust and airy interior. 
- Combine 2 cups bread flour, 1 1/8 tsp instant yeast, 3/4 tsp salt, 1 cup + 2 tbsp warm water, and 1 1/2 tbsp olive oil. 
- Rise for 2 hours, dimple with fingers, add toppings, and bake at 425°F (220°C) for 25 minutes
